{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/11/2712758/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デニム好き系女子です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デニムというか、ズボンが好きかも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボーイッシュな、ラフな、\nスタイリッシュな格好が好きだから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勿論スカートも好き！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリーツスカートの、\n風を受けてふわっと広がる感じがとても好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子でよかったな〜と\n思う瞬間かも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はアルバム特典イベントが\n２つもありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１つは乃木神社参拝。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう１つは黒ひげ危機一髪。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前だけ聞くと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"になるけど( ◦˙ ˙◦ )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始まってみたら楽しいイベントでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木神社参拝は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その名の通りメンバー全員と一緒に\nヒット祈願などをしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"厳粛な雰囲気がとても新鮮でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーとファンの方\nお揃いのお守り(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切にしようね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんが幸せに過ごせますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒ひげ危機一髪は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その名の通りメンバーとファンの方\n一対一で対決をするというものでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が飛ばしてしまったら\nその場で退場という鬼ルールもあり(> <)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてのイベントだったけど\nとても盛り上がりました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒ひげ危機一髪を\n私はあんまりやったことなかったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天高くまで飛んでいく黒ひげに\n常時怖がってました(-_-)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心臓に悪影響...！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって天高くまで飛んでいくんだもん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒ひげの頭だけ柔らかくなってたけど\nあとプラスチックだもん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たると痛いもん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも楽しかった(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑い中来てくれた皆さん\nありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わざわざ遠征して来てくれた方もいて\n本当嬉しかったです( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.